From 6f2f39ab531b4f0e90f3b5c0875ffeef7e8fe41c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julian Zhu <jz531210@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 15:07:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] LoongArch: Include internal/cryptlib.h in loongarchcap.c

It declares OPENSSL_cpuid_setup(). Without it, a --strict-warnings
build fails with -Werror=missing-prototypes.

Fixes #32984

Signed-off-by: Julian Zhu <jz531210@gmail.com>
Reviewed-by: Mounir Idrassi <mounir.idrassi@idrix.fr>
Reviewed-by: Tomas Mraz <tomas@openssl.foundation>
Merge-date: Fri Oct  2 08:19:33 2026
Merged-from: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/32985
(cherry picked from commit d91e23d7663db115676ebd0d7b789011b551e915)
---
 crypto/loongarchcap.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/crypto/loongarchcap.c b/crypto/loongarchcap.c
index 9772a9809036..0dfe5a275453 100644
--- a/crypto/loongarchcap.c
+++ b/crypto/loongarchcap.c
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
  * https://www.openssl.org/source/license.html
  */
 #include <sys/auxv.h>
+#include "internal/cryptlib.h"
 #include "loongarch_arch.h"
 
 unsigned int OPENSSL_loongarch_hwcap_P = 0;
